{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to find unique and exclusive content, paranormal streamer Symon stumbles upon an obscure urban legend known only as the &quot;Phantom Incident&quot;. Hardly any information of the event exists besides mentions in a small newspaper and stories from locals. Seeing this as a perfect scoop for his social media, he jumps at the opportunity to bring new light to the story and gain more followers in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Perigee Gas Station, Henderson Estate and surrounding area, solving puzzles and using your resources wisely to move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document your journey by filming segments and collecting evidence. The evidence you uncover will determine your understanding at the conclusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADDITIONAL INFO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted (English only).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is roughly 45-60 minutes to complete and has multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527080?t=1749691930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527080?t=1749691930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527080/9a23e5e3d57a17a656c217d85626e9530dd8e276/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749691930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527080/9a23e5e3d57a17a656c217d85626e9530dd8e276/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749691930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conte